              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Arooni omunyamurwa yainamuka aha rushozi Hoori ahabw'ekiragiro kya MUKAMA, yaafeerayo omu mwaka gwa makumi ana Abaisraeli barugire omu nsi ya Misri, omu kwezi kwa kataano aha kiro ky'okubanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
