          "text": " mubingye abatuuzi boona ab'omuri egyo nsi, babarugye omumaisho, mucwekyereze ebishushani byabo byona ebibaizirwe omu mabaare, n'ebishushani byabo byona ebiheesire, kandi musheenye emyanya yaabo yoona emikuru ey'okuramizamu, ",
