        },
        {
          "text": " Ensi egyo muryagihungura nimugiteerera enteenyu, nk'emiryango yaanyu oku eri; abaingi muryabaha obuhunguzi bwingi, n'abakye mubahe bukye; ahu enteenyu erikwatira omuntu, niho hariba ahakwe; muryagihungura nk'enganda za bashwenkuriimwe oku ziri. ",
